            <div type="edition">
                <note>The following incipit is taken from <ref type="mss" corresp="ANLcr100"/> according to the catalogue description in
                    <bibl><ptr target="bm:Strelcyn1976Catalogue"/><citedRange unit="page">254</citedRange></bibl>.</note>
                <div type="textpart" subtype="incipit">
                    <ab xml:lang="gez">ስመ፡ አጋንንት። ኖብ፡ የአየር፡ ንጉሥ፡ አፈጋም፡ የባህርና፡ የገደል፡ ንጉሥ፡ ሰደፍ፡ የዛፍ፡ ንጉሥ፡ ቀጨር፡ የባርያ፡ ንጉሥ፡ ዧሌፍ፡ የንዳድ፡ ንጉሥ፡
                        ቆቢን፡ የዛር፡ ንጉሥ፡ ፍናስር፡ የመስተፋቅር፡ ንጉሥ፡</ab>
                </div>
            </div>
